WEBVTT

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.470
Wow!

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:39.180
You wouldn't expect anything less from 5pb, Leanbox's diva, would you?

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.560
Indeed!

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.540
I don't care if it's a concert or whatever,

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:45.370
but you're being way too noisy!

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:48.080
Put yourself in the shoes of those who have to work in this racket.

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:55.050
First things first, I'd like to know why a mouse has to go underwater.

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:58.300
"Sea mouse" means something else entirely! It refers to a worm!

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:03.810
Found it!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.440
Thank you all!

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:11.860
Next up:

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:13.980
Dimension tripper!!!!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:48.490
It's all well and good that she invited us to the concert,

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:52.750
but what's with Vert not showing up herself?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.000
I'm sure she has her reasons.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:03:59.210
Well?

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.920
Which one is Vert's room?

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.390
Hey, it's unlocked!

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.230
What...

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:17.820
...happened here?

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:19.570
It almost looks like this room was broken into.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.820
I think it's more likely that it just hasn't been cleaned up.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:26.490
Oh, this is a game that can only be bought by those over eighteen years of age!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.580
Hey, stop that!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.290
We've got little girls here!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.290
What are the rear guard doing?!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.420
I'll back them up.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.180
You all carry on without me.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.350
Jeez!

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:49.760
That was quick! You could've said <i>something!</i>

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.560
What are you doing, Vert?

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:53.680
Hey!

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.190
Not there!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.940
She's clearly playing an online game.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:00.650
Four Goddesses Online?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.280
Hey! Sorry to see you couldn't make it!

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:04.700
Oh my.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.200
Welcome, ladies.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.450
Sorry, I'm a little tied up right now.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:13.450
Hold it! Why'd you ditch us to play games?!

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:17.040
I thought I'd just play for an hour before leaving,

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.460
but my faction ended up laying siege to the enemy.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.960
I couldn't just up and leave like that.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:26.970
I thought you were going to throw a party for us here after the concert.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.970
We're right about to topple their castle, so if you could wait just a little bit longer...

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:35.810
I never knew she was like this.

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.230
Well, hobbies vary from person to person.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.230
Wow, what a goddess-for-nothing!

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.440
She might be even worse than me!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:43.530
Not a chance.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:44.360
Zoinks!

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.990
They're in perfect sync!

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:47.780
What now?

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.990
Looks like we'll be waiting a bit longer.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.490
Let's see...

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.330
All right!

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.710
Let's get everything ready!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:58.830
What?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.710
Why do <i>we</i> have to?

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.250
Quit whining.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.550
We've come all the way to Leanbox,

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.630
so let's make it a party worth the trip.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:09.430
First off: Nepgear, IF, and Compa,

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:10.720
go shopping for ingredients!

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.220
O-Okay!

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:14.890
Everyone else can help clean up the room.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.520
Begin at once!

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:18.100
There she goes again.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:21.060
She just turns into a total bossypants sometimes.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.900
It's like some weird switch in her brain.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:23.770
Quiet!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:25.860
Get to work!

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:27.130
Looks like Ge-Ge and Iffy aren't here yet.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:32.430
I'd better hurry, or the old hag will yell at me 'til the mice come home.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:43.310
That hurt!

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:59.080
Wh-What?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.500
Is it that amusing to see a mouse trip and fall?

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.580
I'm so glad you're okay!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.760
You look a little bruised, though.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:25.560
There! All better!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:31.940
Be careful, okay, Mister Mouse?

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.900
O-Okay.

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:36.120
I'll take my leave, then.

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:37.950
W-Wait!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.420
Um...

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:48.460
Could I have your name, please?

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:58.850
C-Compa...

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.020
Such a sweet name.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:18.740
Ge-Ge?

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.240
Get your hands off that thing!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.540
What's wrong, Ge-Ge?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.540
I don't know.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.460
It's like all my strength just left me.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.220
Could it be anemia?

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:38.930
But I've never heard of a goddess suffering from anemia.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.900
That was close.

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:52.400
Never thought I'd run into one of the CPU Candidates.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.400
That aside,

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.910
Compa's an angel.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.950
A total angel!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.030
Hnng!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.160
Ladies,

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.960
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.790
Welcome to my party!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:12.800
Actually, Vert,

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:14.460
you didn't do shit.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:15.670
Let's not do this.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.300
You're wasting your breath.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.800
I heard you had a dizzy spell earlier.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:22.390
Yes, but I'm all right now.

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.810
Come now, ladies.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:27.230
Let us eat, drink, and make merry!

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:30.810
I've prepared an extraordinary game for us today!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:32.900
What is it? Tell me!

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.940
I'm sure showing it to you would be quicker than explaining.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:38.280
Neptune and Noire,

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.280
could you step back for a bit, please?

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:41.450
Roger!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:42.870
Huh? What's going on?

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.790
Give us a splendid fight, you two.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:53.670
Wow!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.380
Oh no! Nep-Nep!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:56.420
Zoinks!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.130
I've turned into a Dogoo!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:00.130
I-Is this supposed to be me?

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.140
This special camera captures your movements

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.350
and projects them out in 3D.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.140
Pretty amazing technology, don't you think?

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:10.730
So, you want me to fight Noire like this?

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.060
Hey, you stinking Noigoo!

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.860
I'll send you flying all the way to Planeptune!

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.530
Wh-What the heck's a Noigoo?

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:20.320
Yay! I scored some points!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:22.240
Now I'm mad!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.240
You'd better prepare yourself,

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.410
Nepgoone!

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.660
Look at you, you sucky Noigoo!

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:32.420
By the way, there's also a more realistic combat simulation mode

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.790
which you can use for combat training.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:35.710
Amazing!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.050
That sounds fun.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:38.710
I wanna play too!

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:39.470
Of course!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:41.550
Please, enjoy yourselves!

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:45.930
You're late!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.890
Do you mean to ruin our entire plan?!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.850
I rushed here as fast as I could, you know.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:55.110
It's your fault for making such a tight schedule, hag!

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:59.820
How many times must I tell you to cease addressing me, your superior, in such a way?

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.990
W-Well, whatever.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.370
I can't allow mere mice to perturb me.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.410
Hand you-know-what over already!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.160
Gotcha.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:14.250
Now we have four.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.590
Tonight,

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.840
the rules of this game they call their world

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.680
will be turned upside down.

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.770
Over my dead body!

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.020
What is it?

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.770
We're in the middle of a party here.

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.600
Vert, actually...

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.110
Yikes.

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:46.410
We're done already?

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:49.540
What's wrong, Vert?

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:53.410
Well, there's a waste disposal plant in the Zune district.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:58.130
I hear a large amount of monsters showed up there.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.130
The Zune district...

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:02.630
It's a small island, isn't it?

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:06.430
They say it adjoins land during ebb tide, and only then.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.390
Why are monsters such a big deal? They show up all over, right?

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:11.350
It's an area under this nation's rule,

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.560
so this shouldn't be happening.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:18.060
But it would appear that it is.

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.770
I'll be going there now.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:21.820
Let me tag along!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:26.070
This is a problem for my own country to deal with.

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.870
C'mon, fate must have brought us here today!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.040
Let us help.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:35.660
Doing the whole "we're all friends because we signed a treaty" thing again, are we?

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:36.540
You got that right!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.000
I'll help too.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:42.300
I owe you one after you helped us during the kidnapping incident, after all.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.050
Okay, then! The three of us—

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:45.760
I-I'm coming too!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:49.090
Who knows how long you three would keep us waiting otherwise.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.470
Ladies...

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.180
Very well.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.060
Let the four of us go—

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.100
Um!

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:58.560
I'll come too!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.230
M-Me too!

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.270
Me three!

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:02.980
Me four!

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.610
You girls should stay back.

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.820
This isn't a game.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:06.990
What?

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.070
You need to stay here and keep watch, Uni.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:10.990
You can't even transform yet, after all.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.240
Nepgear!

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.700
Leave this to your trusty ol' sis.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.000
I gotta show off once in a while!

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.170
Okay.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.170
So, on that note,

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:23.960
it's morphin' time!

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:35.140
Let's be on our way, ladies.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:53.490
I'm amazed you were able to scrape so much trash together.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.950
I had to.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:58.500
Otherwise, we wouldn't be able to lure all the CPUs here at once.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.580
Get over here already.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.170
Are you okay, Nepgear?

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.050
Y-Yeah...

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.220
I'm fine,

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:16.350
but I'm kinda worried about Sis.

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:19.850
Is your sister not that strong?

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.480
Nah, it's not like that.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.940
She's really strong when she gets serious.

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:28.610
I'm so weak, but she always keeps me safe.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:30.740
But...

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.780
I don't know why,

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.580
but I have a bad feeling about tonight.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.490
A bad feeling?

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:40.870
Okay, I got it.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.370
Thanks, Otome.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.500
Seems like I was right all along.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.670
Did you figure something out?

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.170
The mouse at the shopping mall looked familiar,

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:54.220
so I asked a friend in the intelligence bureau to look into it for me.

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:58.180
And unsurprisingly, he was on every country's blacklist.

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.310
He's on the list of most wanted people—

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.640
Or should I say, most wanted mice.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:06.980
Huh? Mister Mouse is a bad guy?

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.400
That makes me sad.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:10.530
That's not all.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:14.410
I also found out that he was spotted boarding a boat for the Zune district a few hours ago.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:16.910
Doesn't that mean...

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.740
It's just guesswork at this point,

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:24.370
but somebody probably arranged for those monsters to appear at the waste processing plant.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.090
If I leave now, I can still make it by ebb tide.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.300
I'm gonna go check things out.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:30.550
Me too.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:32.630
Take me with you!

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:34.470
No way.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.760
I can't put you in danger too.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.720
But I'm really worried!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.390
Please, IF!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.150
Land ahoy.

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:54.110
Ugh, look at 'em swarming over it like flies.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:57.410
There's lots of them, but they look easy enough to handle.

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:01.200
But it'd spell big trouble if they somehow managed to make it to the city.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.660
We should hurry up and—

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.110
These fatasses are the big hitters, eh?

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:31.730
Can't complain about our enemies here, can we?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.320
Let's take down one each!

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:36.820
Race you for it!

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.070
I ain't gonna let you one-up <i>me!</i>

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.040
Wait, you three!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:45.580
Basic battle theory says we should team up and take down one at a time!

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:47.960
More like basic cowards' theory.

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.000
Good heavens.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.340
They always get so headstrong when they've activated HDD.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:55.130
Well,

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:58.040
I'm no exception!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.940
Listen up, Nepgear.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:09.690
Whatever happens, don't try the impossible.

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:13.030
We'll retreat the moment we sense any danger.

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:14.110
Okay.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.320
Thank you, IF.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.910
Lace Ribbon Dance!

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:35.880
I win.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.470
Tanzerin Trombe!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.520
Damn, I'm second?

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:50.520
Looks like those two aren't done yet.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:53.480
Rainy Ratnapura!

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:55.440
Cross Combo!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.280
I suppose those two are tied?

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:05.200
That also means they both finished dead last.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:08.910
I was just a little bit faster.

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:09.960
If you say so.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.710
I was last—

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.090
Noire! Blanc!

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:23.180
Wh-What is this?!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:25.680
Don't fuck with me!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.890
Makes my skin crawl!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:29.690
I should just...

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.820
I guess it's about time.

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.150
Is that the one behind this?

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.610
Goddesses,

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:45.450
fall into my sanctuary!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.290
Th-This light...

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.920
I'm losing strength. How?

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:00.920
It's that rock.

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.510
We just need to destroy it!

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:14.440
Anything that depends on Share Energy as the source of its power

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.360
cannot come into contact with that rock.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.150
Be it a weapon,

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.190
or even a goddess.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.700
What is that supposed to mean?

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.620
That rock is called an Anti-Crystal.

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:28.700
It's a stone that severs the link between you and your Share Crystals,

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:30.700
robbing you of your powers and abilities.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.410
Anti-Crystal?

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:37.500
Oh, these are some real Kodak moments.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.800
These pictures are gonna cause quite the commotion around the world.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:47.720
Goddammit!

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:55.810
You're not gonna get away with this!

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:57.860
I'll beat you black and blue!

00:20:58.060 --> 00:20:59.690
I do wonder how you'll manage that.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:04.490
Goddesses inside an Anti-Crystal field will continue to lose their strength and energy.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:08.490
Just hang around and watch your chances of victory go down the drain!

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:16.790
Sure is quiet here.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:19.380
Maybe they're done exterminating the monsters already?

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.680
Nope, they're still around.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:30.970
Where are Neptune and the rest?

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.020
IF!

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:33.980
Look at that!

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:54.120
Sis...

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:29.000
Nep Station!

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.800
Today, we're comin' at you straight from the studio!

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:32.140
Here's today's special guest!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:33.970
I'm 5pb.

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:36.810
Please buy a copy of my new single, Dimension tripper!!!!

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:38.350
This isn't stealth marketing!

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:40.020
Just blatant old-fashioned marketing!
